/- GID: D5/S3/Arith/Additive/NumericalSemigroupRealizability
   generality: G
   mirror-B: D5/B/S3/Arith/Additive/NumericalSemigroupRealizability
   mirror-E: none(waiver:external-open-problem-resolution)
   anchors: [mathlib/module/Mathlib.NumberTheory.FrobeniusNumber]
